Package: pyaudio-termux
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: bash, curl, python, python-pip, clang, make, pkg-config, portaudio, pulseaudio
Recommends: termux-api
Homepage: https://github.com/termux-learn-crypto/pyaudio-termux
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: PyAudio on Termux (no root) with PulseAudio helpers
 apt installs portaudio, pulseaudio, python and the compiler, then
 builds PyAudio during install. Commands: start-audio, pyaudio-test,
 pyaudio-setup (rebuild).
